; LondonRangeBreakout - XAUUSD preset reproducing the EXACT rule set that was backtested
; independently in research_notes/.../independent_backtest_round2.md (test T1):
;   Asian range 03:00-08:00 server, OCO stops at 08:00, SL at far side of range capped at 0.60% of price,
;   TP 2.5R, break-even at 1.5R, unfilled stops deleted and positions closed at 21:00 server,
;   one trade per day, skip days whose range is <0.30% or >1.60% of price, 1% risk.
; Hours are BROKER SERVER TIME and assume a server on New York time + 7 h (UTC+2 winter / UTC+3 summer,
; the convention used by many ECN brokers). On a different server offset shift all hours accordingly.
; Research only. Backtest result 2024-01 to 2026-11 after 42-point round-trip costs: PF 1.33, 603 trades,
; max DD 21.5% at 1% risk, but 65% of the net profit came from 2026 alone and 2024-2025 pooled were not
; statistically distinguishable from zero. NO performance is implied or promised.
; Format: Name=value||start||step||stop||Y/N  (Y = pre-flagged for optimization; ignored in single tests)
RangeStartHour=3||0||1||23||N
RangeStartMinute=0||0||5||55||N
RangeEndHour=8||5||1||10||N
RangeEndMinute=0||0||5||55||N
RangeSource=0||0||0||1||N
MinRangeBars=30||30||10||120||N
UseServerTime=true||false||0||true||N
ServerToUTCOffsetHours=2||2||1||3||N
TradeStartHour=8||7||1||10||N
TradeEndHour=21||9||1||21||N
ForceCloseHour=21||11||1||22||N
OneTradePerDay=true||false||0||true||N
MaxTradesPerDay=1||1||1||3||N
EntryMode=0||0||0||1||N
BufferPoints=20||0||10||100||Y
CancelOppositeOnFill=true||false||0||true||N
BreakoutATRMult=0.15||0.05||0.05||0.5||N
ATRPeriod=14||7||7||28||N
MinRangePctOfPrice=0.3||0.1||0.1||0.6||Y
MaxRangePctOfPrice=1.6||0.8||0.2||2.4||Y
MinRangePoints=0||0||100||1000||N
MaxRangePoints=0||0||500||5000||N
SLMode=0||0||0||1||N
